OL,3,GNEWSAStructural cracks force closure of
OL,4,AGP surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city GP surgery is shutting after NHS
OL,7,Fbosses said the building it is housed
OL,8,Fin suffers from cracks and other
OL,9,Fstructural issues.
OL,11,FThe Trinity Street Surgery in Norwich
OL,12,Fwill close on 27 November and the
OL,13,Fpractice which runs it will consolidate
OL,14,Fits services at its other site in
OL,15,FBowthorpe.
OL,17,FIt means patients wishing to stay with
OL,18,Fthe practice will have to travel to the
OL,19,Foutskirts of Norwich - or register with
OL,20,Fa new surgery locally.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
