OL,3,GNEWSAStructural cracks force closure of
OL,4,AGP surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,FMaxine Webb, a Green Party county
OL,7,Fcouncillor for the area, said she was
OL,8,Fdisappointed at how the closure had
OL,9,Fbeen communicated, leaving little time
OL,10,Ffor people to prepare.
